This product is a Pascal port of libphonenumber, Google's library for parsing,
formatting and validating international phone numbers:

  libphonenumber
  https://github.com/google/libphonenumber
  Copyright (C) 2009 The Libphonenumber Authors
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The source code under src/ is a translation of the upstream Java
implementation (PhoneNumberUtil, ShortNumberInfo, AsYouTypeFormatter,
PhoneNumberMatcher and their helpers). The test units under tests/ named
LibPhoneNumber.UpstreamSuite.* are ports of the corresponding upstream Java test
classes.

The metadata units

  src/LibPhoneNumber.Metadata.Data.pas, .Descs.pas, .Formats.pas
  src/LibPhoneNumber.ShortMetadata.Data.pas, .Descs.pas
  src/LibPhoneNumber.TestingMetadata.Data.pas, .Descs.pas, .Formats.pas
  src/LibPhoneNumber.AlternateFormats.Data.pas

are generated by tools/generate_metadata.ps1 from the upstream resources
PhoneNumberMetadata.xml, ShortNumberMetadata.xml,
PhoneNumberMetadataForTesting.xml and PhoneNumberAlternateFormats.xml of
libphonenumber, at the upstream commit recorded in vendor/versions.md and in
the generated units themselves.

The test suite and the differential tooling use the C# port
libphonenumber-csharp (https://github.com/twcclegg/libphonenumber-csharp,
Apache License, Version 2.0) as a reference oracle. It is restored from NuGet
at test time and is not part of this distribution.
